sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant TW as TimelineView<br/>(Panel Views)
    participant IR as InputRouter<br/>(Input Routing)
    participant ES as EditorState<br/>(Editor State)
    participant EV as EditorView<br/>(Scene View)
    participant CH as CommandHistory<br/>(Commands)
    participant STC as SetTimeCommand<br/>(Commands)
    participant PIC as Picture<br/>(Document Model)

    Note over User,PIC: Preview (документ не меняется)

    User->>IR: MousePressed (в таймлайне)
    IR->>TW: HandleClick(x, y)
    TW->>TW: hit-test бара, m_pendingDrag = true
    TW-->>IR: (drag начат)

    User->>IR: MouseMoved
    IR->>TW: UpdatePreview(x, y)
    TW->>TW: newTime = start + (clickTime - startMouseTime)
    TW->>ES: preview[id].time = newTime
    Note right of ES: Временное состояние,<br/>не документ

    EV->>ES: читает preview
    EV->>EV: Render preview-бара

    Note over User,PIC: Commit (изменение документа)

    User->>IR: MouseReleased
    IR->>TW: Release()
    TW->>ES: preview.erase(id)
    TW-->>IR: TimelineDragResult{Time, oldTime, newTime}
    IR->>IR: CreateTimelineCommand(result)
    IR->>STC: new SetTimeCommand(pic, {id}, {newTime}, false)
    IR->>CH: Execute(cmd)
    CH->>STC: Execute()
    STC->>PIC: SetShapeTimes(ids, newTimes)
    PIC->>PIC: NotifyPictureObservers()
    CH->>CH: push cmd, m_commandIndex++

    Note over User,PIC: Undo

    User->>IR: Ctrl+Z (KeyPressed)
    IR->>CH: Undo()
    CH->>STC: Unexecute()
    STC->>PIC: SetShapeTimes(ids, oldTimes)
    PIC->>PIC: NotifyPictureObservers()
    CH-->>IR: affectedIds
    IR->>ES: ApplySelection(affectedIds)

    Note over User,PIC: Redo

    User->>IR: Ctrl+Y (KeyPressed)
    IR->>CH: Redo()
    CH->>STC: Execute()
    STC->>PIC: SetShapeTimes(ids, newTimes)
    PIC->>PIC: NotifyPictureObservers()
    CH-->>IR: affectedIds
    IR->>ES: ApplySelection(affectedIds)